ly momentum negative; last cycle left-translated (topped early)). This is an UNCONFIRMED TURN, not a confirmed buy. Weekly confirmation lags price, so this exact reading covers BOTH bounces that fail AND the first leg of a genuine new cycle \u2014 you can't tell which in real time, so treat it as a risk/size signal, not a direction call. Measured: weekly-unconfirmed bottoming setups held the low ~49% of the time vs ~68% once the weekly turns up. Last cycle was left-translated (topped early) \u2014 a bearish structural tell.", "next": "Nimble traders only \u2014 small size, defined stop below 192000.0. Not an investment buy yet. What would upgrade it: weekly momentum turning up, a reclaim of the investor-cycle low, or the first daily cycle right-translating \u2014 add on confirmation, not ahead of it.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "bear", "regime_label": "BEARISH", "regime_why": "weekly momentum negative; last cycle left-translated (topped early)", "regime_score": -2.5, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BEARISH \u2014 weekly momentum negative; last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 11 \u00b7 daily cycle day 52).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): unconfirmed turn. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average", "Daily momentum just crossed up", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "UNCONFIRMED \u2014 HIGH RISK", "tag_zh": "\u672a\u786e\u8ba4 \u2014 \u9ad8\u98ce\u9669", "urgency": "caution", "text": "An unconfirmed turn: a daily low is forming while the bigger picture is still bearish. Nimble traders only \u2014 small size, defined stop below 192000.0. Not an investment buy until the weekly confirms; most of these fail, a minority start a new cycle.", "text_zh": "\u672a\u786e\u8ba4\u8f6c\u5411\uff1a\u65e5\u7ebf\u4f4e\u70b9\u6b63\u5728\u5f62\u6210\uff0c\u4f46\u5927\